{"3996340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sunken Souls", "steam_appid": 3996340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig Deep. Fight Hard. Tame the Unknown.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a living labyrinth of caves, monsters, and treasure in this <strong>roguelike RPG mining adventure</strong>. Every run is different - caves collapse, treasures shift, and danger lurks in the dark. Fight through guardians of ancient treasure, tame your own monster companions, and like any good sandbox, carve your own path through the underground.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover More About This Pirate World </strong>– Explore a unique yet familiarly nostalgic pirate labyrinth that has been taken over by an evil presence.  As you uncover the secrets of this burial ground, you will fight a variety of monsters and  infamous pirates, and come up with your own strategies to take them head on. Be the master of your own story or leave up to Lady Luck to guide you to the end!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996340/extras/7d41d0e6e3d2cfb202e1488b5bf4d376.poster.avif?t=1782186783\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996340/extras/7d41d0e6e3d2cfb202e1488b5bf4d376.webm?t=1782186783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996340/extras/7d41d0e6e3d2cfb202e1488b5bf4d376.mp4?t=1782186783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Style Cave Mining</strong> – Blast walls, dig shortcuts, and forge your own path through treacherous caverns. Gather mineral resources to upgrade your weapons and armor. Adventure after luck loot stashes at your own peril to potentially become the most power being in the cave.  Upgrade your tools and skills to move through caves areas seamlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996340/extras/17e1311a85c4a019076d977f13733aa8.poster.avif?t=1782186783\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996340/extras/17e1311a85c4a019076d977f13733aa8.webm?t=1782186783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996340/extras/17e1311a85c4a019076d977f13733aa8.mp4?t=1782186783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Gear Customization </strong>– Shape your hero with traits, gear, and builds that allow you to play how you want. Each run allows for replayability, but it's the equipment variability that allows you to adjust on the move without having to restart each time for the 'perfect starting items.' If all else fails, looks to evil spirits provide you with strong weapons and armors, but their cursed equipment comes at price!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996340/extras/b23af73cc29d9f2e03a9d0c1936d4031.poster.avif?t=1782186783\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996340/extras/b23af73cc29d9f2e03a9d0c1936d4031.webm?t=1782186783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996340/extras/b23af73cc29d9f2e03a9d0c1936d4031.mp4?t=1782186783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb